Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:33:11 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: dma: qcom,gpi: Document the SM6450 GPI DMA
 engine
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The SM6450 GPI DMA engine is compatible with the SM6350 one: its
execution environment sits 0x10000 into the block.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/qcom,gpi.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/qcom,gpi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/qcom,gpi.yaml
index bbe4da2a1..eb0edf29f 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/qcom,gpi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/qcom,gpi.yaml
@@ -35,6 +35,7 @@ properties:
               - qcom,sdx75-gpi-dma
               - qcom,sm6115-gpi-dma
               - qcom,sm6375-gpi-dma
+              - qcom,sm6450-gpi-dma
               - qcom,sm8350-gpi-dma
               - qcom,sm8450-gpi-dma
               - qcom,sm8550-gpi-dma
